sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Admin/Owner/Staff)
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Django as Django Server
    participant Auth as accounts app
    participant Dash as dashboard app
    participant Flocks as flocks app
    participant Inv as inventory app
    participant Feed as feeding app
    participant Med as medicine app
    participant Eggs as eggs app
    participant Mort as mortality app
    participant Sales as sales app
    participant Exp as expenses app
    participant Notif as notifications app
    participant DB as SQLite DB

    %% === AUTHENTICATION FLOW ===
    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User, DB: Authentication Flow
        User->>Browser: Visit / (landing page)
        Browser->>Django: GET /
        Django->>DB: Check if authenticated
        DB-->>Django: Anonymous user
        Django-->>Browser: Render landing page (Three.js 3D scene)
        User->>Browser: Click "Sign In"
        Browser->>Django: GET /login/
        Django-->>Browser: Render login form
        User->>Browser: Enter credentials + Submit
        Browser->>Django: POST /login/
        Django->>Auth: authenticate(username, password)
        Auth->>DB: Query User table
        DB-->>Auth: User record
        Auth-->>Django: Authenticated user
        Django->>DB: Create session
        Django-->>Browser: 302 Redirect → /dashboard/
        Browser->>Django: GET /dashboard/
    end

    %% === DASHBOARD FLOW ===
    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User, DB: Dashboard Overview
        Django->>DB: Query FlockBatch (total chickens)
        Django->>DB: Query InventoryItem (low stock, expired)
        Django->>DB: Query EggProduction (today/week/month)
        Django->>DB: Query MortalityRecord (30-day)
        Django->>DB: Query SalesRecord (week/month)
        Django->>DB: Query ExpenseRecord (week/month)
        Django->>DB: Query ActivityLog (last 10)
        DB-->>Django: Aggregated data
        Django->>Notif: Inject unread_notifications count
        Notif->>DB: Query Notification (unread)
        DB-->>Notif: Unread count
        Notif-->>Django: Context with notification count
        Django-->>Browser: Render dashboard (cards, charts, activity log)
    end

    %% === FLOCK MANAGEMENT (HTMX) ===
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User, DB: Flock Management (CRUD via HTMX)
        User->>Browser: Click "Flocks" in sidebar
        Browser->>Django: GET /flocks/
        Django->>DB: Query all FlockBatch records
        DB-->>Django: Flock list
        Django-->>Browser: Render flock_list.html

        User->>Browser: Click "Add Flock" button
        Browser->>Django: GET /flocks/create/ (HX-Request: true)
        Django-->>Browser: Return _form.html partial (modal)

        User->>Browser: Fill form + Submit
        Browser->>Django: POST /flocks/create/ (HX-Request: true)
        Django->>DB: INSERT INTO flocks_flockbatch (...)
        Django->>Notif: log_activity("Created Flock Batch #X")
        Notif->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications_activitylog (...)
        Django-->>Browser: <script> close modal + reload
        Browser->>Django: GET /flocks/
        Django-->>Browser: Updated flock list
    end

    %% === INVENTORY + FEEDING (AUTO DEDUCTION) ===
    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over User, DB: Feeding Record with Auto Inventory Deduction
        User->>Browser: Navigate to /feeding/create/
        Browser->>Django: GET /feeding/create/
        Django->>DB: Query active FlockBatch + Feed InventoryItems
        DB-->>Django: Flocks + feed items
        Django-->>Browser: Render feeding form

        User->>Browser: Select flock + feed item + quantity + Submit
        Browser->>Django: POST /feeding/create/
        Django->>DB: INSERT INTO feeding_feedingrecord (...)
        Django->>Inv: Create InventoryTransaction (stock out)
        Inv->>DB: INSERT INTO inventory_inventorytransaction (type=out, qty=...)
        Inv->>DB: UPDATE inventory_inventoryitem SET quantity = quantity - qty
        DB-->>Inv: Updated inventory
        Inv-->>Django: Transaction saved

        alt Feed below reorder level
            Inv->>Notif: notify_low_stock(item)
            Notif->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications_notification (type=low_stock) FOR ALL active users
        end

        Django->>Notif: log_activity("Recorded feeding for Flock #X")
        Notif->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications_activitylog (...)
        Django-->>Browser: Success → close modal + reload
    end

    %% === MORTALITY RECORDING (AUTO FLOCK UPDATE) ===
    rect rgb(255, 255, 220)
        Note over User, DB: Mortality Recording with Flock Quantity Update
        User->>Browser: Navigate to /mortality/create/
        Browser->>Django: GET /mortality/create/
        Django->>DB: Query active FlockBatch records
        DB-->>Django: Flock list
        Django-->>Browser: Render mortality form

        User->>Browser: Select flock + cause + quantity + Submit
        Browser->>Django: POST /mortality/create/
        Django->>DB: INSERT INTO mortality_mortalityrecord (...)
        Django->>DB: Recalculate total deaths for flock
        Django->>DB: UPDATE flocks_flockbatch SET current_quantity = original - total_mortality
        Django->>Notif: log_activity("Recorded mortality for Flock #X")
        Notif->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications_activitylog (...)
        Django-->>Browser: Success → close modal + reload
    end

    %% === EGG PRODUCTION ===
    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over User, DB: Egg Production Recording
        User->>Browser: Navigate to /eggs/create/
        Browser->>Django: GET /eggs/create/
        Django->>DB: Query active FlockBatch records
        DB-->>Django: Flock list
        Django-->>Browser: Render egg production form

        User->>Browser: Select flock + good/cracked/rejected counts + Submit
        Browser->>Django: POST /eggs/create/
        Django->>DB: INSERT INTO eggs_eggproduction (...)
        Note over Django: Auto-calculates total_eggs = good + cracked + rejected
        Django->>Notif: log_activity("Recorded egg production for Flock #X")
        Notif->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications_activitylog (...)
        Django-->>Browser: Success → close modal + reload
    end

    %% === MEDICINE/VACCINATION ===
    rect rgb(230, 230, 255)
        Note over User, DB: Medicine/Vaccination with Optional Inventory Deduction
        User->>Browser: Navigate to /medicine/create/
        Browser->>Django: GET /medicine/create/
        Django->>DB: Query FlockBatch + InventoryItems (medicine/vaccine/vitamin)
        DB-->>Django: Data
        Django-->>Browser: Render medicine form

        User->>Browser: Select flock + type + optional medicine item + schedule + Submit
        Browser->>Django: POST /medicine/create/
        Django->>DB: INSERT INTO medicine_medicinerecord (...)
        
        alt Medicine item selected
            Django->>Inv: Create InventoryTransaction (stock out)
            Inv->>DB: INSERT INTO inventory_inventorytransaction (type=out)
            Inv->>DB: UPDATE inventory_inventoryitem SET quantity = quantity - qty
        end

        alt Type = vaccine AND next_schedule set
            Django->>Notif: notify_vaccination_due(record)
            Notif->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications_notification (type=vaccination) FOR ALL active users
        end

        Django->>Notif: log_activity("Recorded medicine for Flock #X")
        Notif->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications_activitylog (...)
        Django-->>Browser: Success → close modal + reload
    end

    %% === SALES RECORDING ===
    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over User, DB: Sales Recording
        User->>Browser: Navigate to /sales/create/
        Browser->>Django: GET /sales/create/
        Django->>DB: Query Buyer list + FlockBatch
        DB-->>Django: Buyers + flocks
        Django-->>Browser: Render sales form

        User->>Browser: Select product type + buyer + qty + unit price + Submit
        Browser->>Django: POST /sales/create/
        Django->>DB: INSERT INTO sales_salesrecord (...)
        Note over Django: Auto-calculates total_amount = quantity × unit_price
        Django->>Notif: log_activity("Recorded sale to Buyer #X")
        Notif->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications_activitylog (...)
        Django-->>Browser: Success → close modal + reload
    end

    %% === EXPENSE RECORDING ===
    rect rgb(240, 240, 230)
        Note over User, DB: Expense Recording
        User->>Browser: Navigate to /expenses/create/
        Browser->>Django: GET /expenses/create/
        Django->>DB: Query ExpenseCategory list
        DB-->>Django: Categories
        Django-->>Browser: Render expense form

        User->>Browser: Select category + amount + description + Submit
        Browser->>Django: POST /expenses/create/
        Django->>DB: INSERT INTO expenses_expenserecord (...)
        Django->>Notif: log_activity("Recorded expense: [description]")
        Notif->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications_activitylog (...)
        Django-->>Browser: Success → close modal + reload
    end

    %% === REPORT GENERATION + EXCEL EXPORT ===
    rect rgb(230, 255, 245)
        Note over User, DB: Report Generation & Excel Export
        User->>Browser: Click "Reports" in sidebar
        Browser->>Django: GET /reports/
        Django-->>Browser: Render reports hub page

        User->>Browser: Click "Production Report"
        Browser->>Django: GET /reports/production/
        Django->>DB: Query EggProduction (last 30 days) + FlockBatch
        DB-->>Django: Report data
        Django-->>Browser: Render production report table

        User->>Browser: Click "Export to Excel"
        Browser->>Django: GET /reports/production/export-excel/
        Django->>DB: Query production data
        DB-->>Django: Raw data
        Note over Django: openpyxl creates .xlsx workbook
        Django-->>Browser: HttpResponse (Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats...)
        Browser-->>User: Download .xlsx file
    end

    %% === NOTIFICATION FLOW ===
    rect rgb(255, 235, 245)
        Note over User, DB: Notification System
        Note over Notif, DB: Context processor runs on EVERY request
        Django->>Notif: context_processor(request)
        Notif->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM notifications_notification WHERE user=X AND is_read=False
        DB-->>Notif: unread_count
        Notif-->>Django: {'unread_notifications': count}
        Note over Django: Injected into base.html top bar bell icon

        User->>Browser: Click bell icon
        Browser->>Django: GET /notifications/
        Django->>DB: Query Notification (unread for user)
        DB-->>Django: Notification list
        Django-->>Browser: Render notification list

        User->>Browser: Click "Mark as read"
        Browser->>Django: GET /notifications/<pk>/read/
        Django->>DB: UPDATE notifications_notification SET is_read=True
        Django-->>Browser: Redirect → /notifications/
    end

    %% === LOGOUT ===
    rect rgb(240, 230, 240)
        Note over User, DB: Logout
        User->>Browser: Click "Logout"
        Browser->>Django: POST /logout/
        Django->>DB: Delete session
        Django-->>Browser: 302 Redirect → /login/
    end
